<title>TURKEY: Istanbul's Bosphorus reopened to southbound traffi.</title>
<headline>Istanbul's Bosphorus reopened to southbound traffi.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istanbul's narrow Bosphorus were opened to traffic from the north on Thursday around midday, maritime officials said.</p>
<p>The straits, closed since 1945 GMT on Wednesday due to heavy fog, were open from the north, from the Black Sea to the Sea of Marmara, to allow the passage of a number of large tankers, the officials said.</p>
</text>
